import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Paean Verity"
	description="The story and heart behind Paean Verity."
	pubDate={new Date('July 15 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		Paean Verity began with a simple conviction: truth isn't meant to stay on
		the page. It's meant to be carried — into your mornings, your quiet
		moments, the ordinary hours of an ordinary week — until it becomes the
		song your whole life sings.
	</p>

	<p>
		We create scripture-anchored devotionals, coloring books, and printable
		resources designed to help you build a home, a habit, and a heart shaped
		by what's true. Whether it's a coloring page that invites stillness, a
		devotional that walks you through scripture line by line, or a printable
		reminder to carry through your day, everything we make starts with the
		same question: does this help truth take root?
	</p>

	<p>
		Paean Verity is for anyone who wants their faith to feel less like a
		checklist and more like a rhythm — something woven into daily life rather
		than set apart from it. We believe formation happens slowly, in small and
		repeated moments, and we want to be part of that process with you.
	</p>

	<p>
		Thank you for being here. We hope what you find in this space becomes a
		steady companion in your own walk of faith.
	</p>

	<p>
		Explore the <a href="/blog">blog</a> for devotionals and reflections, or
		visit the <a href="https://selar.com/m/paean-verity1" target="_blank">shop</a>
		to see the full collection.
	</p>
</Layout>
